wrappable() accepts a single SELECT/WITH statement (semicolons inside
strings, dollar quotes, and comments ignored; trailing terminators
allowed); wrap() builds the
'select * from (…) zedium_page [order by …] limit N offset M' paging
query. quote_ident moves here as the canonical home, re-exported from
connection::introspect for existing callers.

